<div class=\"fr\">\n<h1 class=\"title-h1\">Submersible Well Pump</h1>\n<p>​The submersible well pumps offer a wide performance range, making it easy to find a model that will suit your individual requirements.</p>\n<a class=\"special_read\" href=\"#p1\" rel=\"nofollow\">Send Inquiry</a>\n<div class=\"share-btn-list\"></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"watch_botton\">\n<div class=\"button_box\">\n<button class=\"the_first\">Product Details</button>\n<p><input id=\"productID\" name=\"productID\" type=\"hidden\" value=\"52041365\"/></p><p><strong>submersible well pump</strong><br/></p><p><img src=\"/Content/upload/2018348866/201808231429327851587.jpg\" style=\"\" title=\"image007(001).jpg\"/></p><p>The submersible well pumps offer a wide performance range, making it easy to find a model that will suit your individual requirements.</p><p><strong>1. Product Parameter (specification)</strong></p><p><strong>Categories:</strong> submersible pumps</p><p><strong>Flow</strong> (m3/h): 5.8</p><p><strong>Head</strong> (m): 4 / 173</p><p><strong>Power</strong> (kW): 0.55 / 2.2</p><p><strong>Construction:</strong></p><p>Submersible motor pumps for deep wells of 4″ (DN 100 mm).</p><p>Sized for connection to the motor according to NEMA Standards.</p><p>Delivery casing with built-in non-return valve.</p><p>Delivery port G 1 1/4. Radial floating impeller with high reliability operating in sandy water.</p><p><strong>Performance:</strong></p><p>Capacity up to 5.8 m3/h.</p><p>Head up to 173m.</p><p>Rated motor power output up to 2.2 kW.</p><p>Rotation speed 2850 r.p.m. (motor frequency 50 Hz).</p><p><strong>2. Performance Curve</strong></p><p><strong><img alt=\"image009(001).jpg\" src=\"/Content/upload/2018348866/201808231432011433265.jpg\"/></strong></p><p><strong><img alt=\"image005(001).jpg\" src=\"/Content/upload/2018348866/201808231429291648868.jpg\" style=\"white-space: normal;\"/></strong></p><p><strong>3. Spare Parts</strong></p><table border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" class=\"table\" width=\"100%\"><tbody><tr class=\"firstRow\"><td align=\"left\" style=\"\" valign=\"top\" width=\"383\"><p>Copper Motor</p><p><img alt=\"image011(001).jpg\" src=\"/Content/upload/2018348866/201808231432364088425.jpg\"/></p><p>·With food grade oil never pollute the water</p><p>·Lower temperature and longer lifespan for the motor</p><p><br/></p></td><td align=\"left\" style=\"\" valign=\"top\" width=\"383\"><p>arious Choices </p><p><img alt=\"image013(001).jpg\" src=\"/Content/upload/2018348866/201808231432455795227.jpg\"/></p><p>·Stainless steel / Copper / Iron suction chamber</p><p>·Copper/ Iron oil chamber</p><p><br/></p></td></tr><tr><td align=\"left\" style=\"\" valign=\"top\" width=\"383\"><p>Plastic Impeller </p><p><img alt=\"image015(001).jpg\" src=\"/Content/upload/2018348866/201808231432562731398.jpg\"/></p><p>·Bearing high flow rate and pressure</p><p>·Protected by the impeller case</p><p><br/></p></td><td align=\"left\" style=\"\" valign=\"top\" width=\"383\"><p>Mechanical Seal </p><p><img alt=\"image017(001).jpg\" src=\"/Content/upload/2018348866/201808231433067382661.jpg\"/></p><p>·No oil-leakage keep the well safe</p><p>·Water and sand proof keep the motor safe</p><p><br/></p></td></tr></tbody></table><p><strong>4. Product Application</strong></p><p>Irrigation in horticulture and agriculture</p><p>Groundwater lowering</p><p>Pressure boosting</p><p>Groundwater supply to small waterworks</p><p>Industrial applications</p><p><img alt=\"image019(001).jpg\" src=\"/Content/upload/2018348866/201808231437077233792.jpg\"/></p><p><br/></p><p><br/></p><p><br/></p>\n</div>\n<p class=\"productsTags\"> Hot Tags: submersible well pump, China, suppliers, manufacturers, buy</p>\n<div class=\"ptit\">Related Products</div>\n<ul class=\"rollPro1\">\n<li>\n<div class=\"pbox\"><a href=\"/3-submersible-pump/3-submersible-impeller-pump/well-pump\"><img alt=\"Well Pump\" border=\"0\" src=\"/uploads/201816806/small/well-pump41192001833a77d.jpg?size=